INSERT INTO `matches` VALUES ('match_1760335905795_waagloojh','2025-10-13 06:11:45','2025-10-13 06:11:45','pending',0.95,'lost-1760335689609-klgc3pmwd','crochet wallet with keychain','A circular, crocheted coin purse with Rasta-colored stripes (black, green, red, and yellow) is attached to a keychain. The keychain also features a small wooden charm resembling a strawberry, along with a strand of small rosary white beads.','Accessories','CC9H+JG8, Iriga City, Bicol, Philippines',13.41865110,123.42907260,'2025-10-12 22:08:11','2025-10-12','Gwyneth Buenconsejo','gwbuenconsejo@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760335613554_n818sq0z.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"crocheted coin purse\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"keychain\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"strawberry charm\",\"confidence\":0.95},{\"name\":\"beads\",\"confidence\":0.9}]','[\"Accessories\",\"Handmade\"]','found-1760335901341-kxohfactb','wallet','A close-up shot of a hand holding a crocheted circular item adorned with red, yellow, and green concentric rings against a backdrop of blurred green foliage and tree trunks. The item appears to be a small pouch or coin purse, with a black knitted center and radiating colorful crochet work. Attached to it is a keyring with a decorative element that resembles a strawberry. There is also a strand of white beads with amber accents, and a small, metallic charm shaped like a cross.','Accessories','CC9H+JG8, Iriga City, Bicol, Philippines',13.41864880,123.42906880,'2025-10-12 22:11:41','2025-10-13','Kaila Buenconsejo','kabuenconsejo@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760335810993_hygtt8bs.jpg','[{\"name\":\"crocheted coin purse\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"keychain\",\"confidence\":0.97},{\"name\":\"strawberry charm\",\"confidence\":0.95},{\"name\":\"beaded strand\",\"confidence\":0.93},{\"name\":\"metallic charm\",\"confidence\":0.9},{\"name\":\"hand\",\"confidence\":0.99}]','[\"Accessories\",\"Crafts\",\"Jewelry\",\"Horticulture\"]'),('match_1760337233113_6rinyphz5','2025-10-13 06:33:53','2025-10-13 06:33:53','pending',0.85,'lost-1760337134414-geneqogtq','Ring','A close-up shot captures a diamond engagement ring being held between a person\'s fingers. The ring features a silver band with small diamonds embedded along its surface, leading to a prominent central diamond that sparkles under the light. The background is a softly blurred neutral tone, directing all attention to the intricate details of the ring.','Jewelry','CSPC Entry Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40601740,123.37521140,'2025-10-12 22:32:14','2025-10-12','francine louise libreja','frlibreja@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760337092031_uhzoj2iy.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"ring\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"diamond\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"finger\",\"confidence\":0.96}]','[\"Jewelry\",\"Jewelry\",\"Engagement ring\",\"Diamond ring\"]','found-1760337229353-86xeylzvw','Diamond ring','A close-up, angled shot of a silver ring with a clear gemstone is centered on a textured, dark gray surface. The ring band is smooth and rounded, with the gemstone prominently displayed at the top. The gemstone appears to be faceted and reflects light, suggesting it is likely a diamond or a clear cubic zirconia. The background has a rough, almost pebbled texture and is dark, which helps the shiny ring stand out.','Jewelry','CSPC Entry Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40596300,123.37545400,'2025-10-12 22:33:49','2025-10-13','Andrea nicole Rancapollo','anrancapollo@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760337194293_xlynp54i.jpg','[{\"name\":\"ring\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"gemstone\",\"confidence\":0.98}]','[\"Jewelry\",\"Jewelry\",\"Gemstone\"]'),('match_1760425812967_x6mj6cymu','2025-10-14 07:10:12','2025-10-14 07:18:16','resolved',0.95,'lost-1760425776923-i19i923ph','payong','A closed green umbrella with the handle visible at the bottom. The umbrella is resting on a wooden surface. The fabric of the umbrella is gathered and secured with a band that has the word \"DENVER\" embossed on it. The handle is black and features a circular button. The wooden surface appears to be a table with a visible grain pattern and some minor imperfections.','Accessory','C94G+H24, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40619890,123.37540370,'2025-10-13 23:09:38','2025-10-13','Ann Kyla Aquiler','anaquiler@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760425673266_10bixef9.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"umbrella\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"handle\",\"confidence\":0.95},{\"name\":\"button\",\"confidence\":0.85},{\"name\":\"table\",\"confidence\":0.8}]','[\"Accessory\",\"Outdoor gear\"]','found-1760425803485-3kwm4i00t','Umbrella','A folded, dark green umbrella lies horizontally on a surface with a patterned wood grain design. The umbrella is closed and secured with a fabric band. The handle, which is black and cylindrical, is visible on the left side, with a black strap attached.','Accessory','C95G+348, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40783740,123.37543980,'2025-10-13 23:10:04','2025-10-14','Gwyneth Buenconsejo','gwbuenconsejo@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760425556673_5f0ahlue.jpg','[{\"name\":\"umbrella\",\"confidence\":0.99}]','[\"Accessory\",\"Outdoor gear\"]'),('match_1760499178833_lm8058uk7','2025-10-15 03:32:58','2025-10-15 03:32:58','pending',0.95,'lost-1760499170618-6wa43cxzo','RAPPO Powerbank','A white power bank with the brand name \"rapoo\" and the number \"20\" printed on it, resting on an orange tray with a yellow cord. The power bank has a sleek, rectangular design with rounded edges. A small black indicator light is visible on the left side of the power bank, and a subtle seam runs along its perimeter.','Electronics','CSPC Entry Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40568650,123.37727440,'2025-10-14 19:32:50','2025-10-15','Loren Roxas','loroxas@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760499126275_9dutfsyv.jpg','[{\"name\":\"power bank\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"yellow cord\",\"confidence\":0.92},{\"name\":\"orange tray\",\"confidence\":0.9}]','[\"Electronics\",\"Charging accessory\"]','found-1760279659209-rhty5j28c','Powerbankkk','A white power bank with \"RAPPO\" branding embossed on the top left and a charging indicator bar showing \"20000mAh\" on the right side. The power bank is resting on a white, textured surface that appears to be fabric. There is also a small icon resembling a pointing finger on the lower left side of the power bank.','electronics','1, Bato, Bicol, Philippines',13.35676340,123.37537140,'2025-10-12 06:34:20','2025-10-11','Charles Christian Serrano','ccserrano@my.cspc.edu.ph','Information Technology','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760279630750_17spttce.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"power bank\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"charging indicator\",\"confidence\":0.95},{\"name\":\"branding\",\"confidence\":0.9},{\"name\":\"pointing finger icon\",\"confidence\":0.85}]','[\"electronics\",\"portable charger\"]'),('match_1761498030381_v96gdh0nl','2025-10-26 17:00:30','2025-10-26 17:00:30','pending',0.95,'lost-1761498026825-w2grbr7so','Mouse','A close-up, slightly out-of-focus shot of a black and gray computer mouse resting on a patterned surface, likely a mousepad. The mouse has a matte black finish with a textured gray band around its middle. The scroll wheel and left and right buttons are visible at the top. The A4TECH logo is visible on the lower part of the mouse, with the letters \'CH\' clearly discernible. The background is a dark, textured surface with a colorful, blurry graphic, possibly an artistic design or a game-related image. The lighting creates a shadow to the right of the mouse.','Computer peripherals','7126 Pan-Philippine Highway, Poblacion, Bato, Bato, Camarines Sur, Philippines',13.35659540,123.37572910,'2025-10-26 09:00:26','2025-10-26','Loren Roxas','loroxas@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1761498011115_z6qg78pu.jpg','[{\"name\":\"computer mouse\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"mousepad\",\"confidence\":0.85},{\"name\":\"A4TECH logo\",\"confidence\":0.95}]','[\"Computer peripherals\",\"Electronics\",\"Input devices\"]','found-1761497879702-3b6pf2i31','Missing a4tech','Black mouse','Computer peripherals','1, Bato, Bicol, Philippines',13.35658050,123.37573950,'2025-10-26 08:57:59','2025-10-25','Charles Christian Serrano','ccserrano@my.cspc.edu.ph','Information Technology','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1761497841214_g5asfhmu.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"computer mouse\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"laptop keyboard\",\"confidence\":0.95}]','[\"Computer peripherals\",\"Electronics\"]'),('match_1762320307372_08neegt3a','2025-11-05 05:25:07','2025-11-05 05:25:07','pending',0.90,'lost-1760337358539-k0dkqauwq','Tecno phone','A close-up shot showcases the rear of a pink smartphone case adorned with a pattern of pink and white bows. The case features a prominent camera module with three lenses and a flash. The \'Bowknot\' text is visible below the camera array. The hand holding the phone is partially visible on the right, and the corner of a blue garment is visible on the left.','Electronics','CSPC Entry Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40596170,123.37541470,'2025-10-12 22:35:58','2025-10-12','Angelyn Aleman','analeman@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760337316593_0tzdtyua.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"smartphone case\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"bow\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"camera\",\"confidence\":0.95},{\"name\":\"lens\",\"confidence\":0.93}]','[\"Electronics\",\"Accessories\",\"Fashion\"]','found-1762320268041-p6xlee42f','Phone','A close-up shot of a pink iPhone case adorned with a pattern of bows. The case has a cut-out for the camera module, which shows three lenses and the text \'50MP AI CAMERA\'. The bows are depicted in various sizes, some in pink and others in a lighter, outlined style. The word \'Bowknot\' is printed in black text near the bottom of the case.','Electronics','Poblacion Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40569480,123.37710160,'2025-11-04 21:24:29','2025-11-05','Edgardo Dimacali','eddimacali@my.cspc.edu.ph','Education','https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1762320224782_e18y5oxi.jpg','[{\"name\":\"phone case\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"camera module\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"bow pattern\",\"confidence\":0.97},{\"name\":\"text \'Bowknot\'\",\"confidence\":0.95}]','[\"Electronics\",\"Accessories\",\"Phone case\"]'),('match_1762320307393_l2lc1sloi','2025-11-05 05:25:07','2025-11-05 05:25:07','pending',0.75,'lost-1760441090628-t3gj5xkrn','iPhone','a smartphone in a light purple case while taking a selfie in a mirror.','Electronics','9CXJ+CX2, Iriga City, Bicol, Philippines',13.39683770,123.43383210,'2025-10-14 03:24:51','2025-10-13','APRIL PEÑONES','appenones@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760440984034_fq23n1f6.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"smartphone\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"phone case\",\"confidence\":0.97},{\"name\":\"wrist strap\",\"confidence\":0.96},{\"name\":\"t-shirt\",\"confidence\":0.95},{\"name\":\"mirror\",\"confidence\":0.9}]','[\"Electronics\",\"Accessories\",\"Clothing\",\"Personal care\"]','found-1762320268041-p6xlee42f','Phone','A close-up shot of a pink iPhone case adorned with a pattern of bows. The case has a cut-out for the camera module, which shows three lenses and the text \'50MP AI CAMERA\'. The bows are depicted in various sizes, some in pink and others in a lighter, outlined style. The word \'Bowknot\' is printed in black text near the bottom of the case.','Electronics','Poblacion Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40569480,123.37710160,'2025-11-04 21:24:29','2025-11-05','Edgardo Dimacali','eddimacali@my.cspc.edu.ph','Education','https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1762320224782_e18y5oxi.jpg','[{\"name\":\"phone case\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"camera module\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"bow pattern\",\"confidence\":0.97},{\"name\":\"text \'Bowknot\'\",\"confidence\":0.95}]','[\"Electronics\",\"Accessories\",\"Phone case\"]'),('match_1764535587613_m4w0whvl2','2025-11-30 20:46:27','2025-11-30 20:46:27','pending',0.90,'lost-1762327802470-sb2mrjsxa','Phone','A close-up shot of a light purple water bottle with a textured cap and a flip-top lid is the central focus. The bottle is positioned on a surface covered with a delicate, light blue crocheted doily, which in turn is laid over a wooden table. In the background, several items are visible: a cardboard box with some Chinese characters and a checkmark, a framed picture, a plant in a pot, and wooden cylindrical objects. The lighting is somewhat dim, creating soft shadows.','Drinkware','13°24\'20.4\"N 123°22\'33.8\"E',13.40567310,123.37604730,'2025-11-04 23:30:03','2025-11-04','Lysa Dimanarig','lydimanarig@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1762327685320_p8w4mszm.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"water bottle\",\"confidence\":0.98},{\"name\":\"doily\",\"confidence\":0.96},{\"name\":\"cardboard box\",\"confidence\":0.94},{\"name\":\"picture frame\",\"confidence\":0.9},{\"name\":\"plant pot\",\"confidence\":0.85}]','[\"Drinkware\",\"Home decor\",\"Kitchenware\"]','found-1760443686924-jiea10pw3','tumbler','A light purple water bottle with a flip-up straw is placed on a table covered with a patterned tablecloth. The background is a plain, light-colored wall.','Drinkware','Narra St., Iriga City, Bicol, Philippines',13.42360190,123.42202300,'2025-10-14 04:08:08','2025-10-13','Christine Joy Frondozo','chfrondozo@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1760443604136_wghq0ffb.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"water bottle\",\"confidence\":0.98}]','[\"Drinkware\",\"Container\",\"Kitchenware\"]'),('match_1764568901502_u4senw3g4','2025-12-01 06:01:41','2025-12-01 06:01:41','pending',0.95,'lost-1761550669983-8mvr2k25u','Lost gaming mouse','A close-up, top-down view of a white and blue computer mouse with a red \'DPI\' button and a prominent scroll wheel. The mouse has futuristic detailing and the brand name \'Zeus\' is visible. It is placed on a dark, textured surface, possibly a desk.','Electronics','Poblacion Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40572640,123.37707090,'2025-10-26 23:37:51','2025-10-25','Christine Joy Frondozo','chfrondozo@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1761550611170_3kofu7s1.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"computer mouse\",\"confidence\":0.99}]','[\"Electronics\",\"Computer peripherals\",\"Input devices\"]','found-1761550998142-1sq4vgssj','Gaming mouse','A white and blue computer mouse with red buttons is shown from a top-down angle. The mouse has a sleek design with some graphic elements and text on it, including the word \"ZEUS\" prominently displayed. The mouse rests on a dark, textured surface, possibly a mousepad or desk.','Electronics','Poblacion Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40570510,123.37705190,'2025-10-26 23:43:18','2025-10-26','Loren Roxas','loroxas@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1761550810998_8go8r7e9.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"computer mouse\",\"confidence\":0.99}]','[\"Electronics\",\"Computer accessories\"]'),('match_1764569275416_snxhegwg8','2025-12-01 06:07:55','2025-12-01 06:07:55','pending',0.95,'lost-1761127426431-ubqccpjba','umbrella','A pink umbrella is lying on a tiled floor. The umbrella is partially closed, with its fabric bunched up and its metal ribs visible. The handle is also partially visible and appears to be pink as well.','Accessory','Poblacion Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40567330,123.37715590,'2025-10-22 02:03:47','2025-10-21','Christine Joy Frondozo','chfrondozo@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1761127397490_43tjudr4.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"umbrella\",\"confidence\":0.99}]','[\"Accessory\",\"Weather protection\"]','found-1761120948126-2fp1iifwt','Umbrella','A person is holding a partially closed pink umbrella. The umbrella has a black interior and a pink handle. The background shows a tiled floor and a wall with blue and black stripes.  Part of another person\'s legs can be seen in the upper left corner.','Accessory','Poblacion Road, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40567280,123.37715920,'2025-10-22 00:15:48','2025-10-21','Loren Roxas','loroxas@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1761120926205_ye3jmcdt.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"umbrella\",\"confidence\":0.97},{\"name\":\"hand\",\"confidence\":0.96},{\"name\":\"wall\",\"confidence\":0.85},{\"name\":\"floor\",\"confidence\":0.8}]','[\"Accessory\",\"Weather protection\"]'),('match_1764575982269_fmrdubbh1','2025-12-01 07:59:42','2025-12-01 19:05:39','resolved',1.00,'lost-1764575881776-7y7889meq','Lost Accessory','A light brown textured wallet with a silver logo and a wrist strap is displayed against a white background. The wallet is oriented horizontally, with its flap closed and a thin wrist strap attached to the left side. The material of the wallet has a subtle, embossed pattern. The logo, a small silver emblem, is centered on the front of the wallet.','Accessory','1, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40935240,123.37212750,'2025-11-30 23:58:02','2025-11-30','Sean Matthew Capistrano','secapistrano@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','[\"https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1764574113820_cvs6e1py.jpg\"]','[{\"name\":\"wallet\",\"confidence\":0.99}]','[\"Accessory\",\"Fashion\",\"Bag\"]','found-1764575967280-nth3hy1c9','Light brown wallet','A light brown, textured wallet with a silver-toned emblem is shown against a white background. A wrist strap extends from the left side of the wallet.','Accessory','1, Nabua, Bicol, Philippines',13.40935170,123.37212990,'2025-11-30 23:59:28','2025-12-01','Christine Joy Frondozo','chfrondozo@my.cspc.edu.ph','CSPC Student','https://api.lostfound.systems/uploads/1764575954393_0ex2n4kl.jpg','[{\"name\":\"wallet\",\"confidence\":0.99},{\"name\":\"wrist strap\",\"confidence\":0.97},{\"name\":\"emblem\",\"confidence\":0.96}]','[\"Accessory\",\"Fashion\"]');
